    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini-Games</strong></h2>The mini-games are very varied so you'll never get bored. Racing, puzzle, reflex-based, platforming, vision sharpness, you name it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/69cabfc0b17ab165cf2ab4114252689d.poster.avif?t=1720787293\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/69cabfc0b17ab165cf2ab4114252689d.webm?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/69cabfc0b17ab165cf2ab4114252689d.mp4?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local/Online</strong></h2>You can play locally on the same computer with multiple controllers. Or if you and your friends are not able to gather in one place then you can still enjoy the game together online.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/ef69c65dff8de62e7e64807d0aa210e3.poster.avif?t=1720787293\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/ef69c65dff8de62e7e64807d0aa210e3.webm?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/ef69c65dff8de62e7e64807d0aa210e3.mp4?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Matchmaking</strong></h2>Play the game with people from all over the world with online matchmaking!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/e90e5c02acd7a5e68f9ba8b95329072d.poster.avif?t=1720787293\" width=760 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/e90e5c02acd7a5e68f9ba8b95329072d.webm?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/e90e5c02acd7a5e68f9ba8b95329072d.mp4?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skins Editor</strong></h2>You can customize your character to your liking with a huge array of cosmetics. All for free!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/240f64fb572cdbc04e2be231c5e99fd0.poster.avif?t=1720787293\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/240f64fb572cdbc04e2be231c5e99fd0.webm?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/240f64fb572cdbc04e2be231c5e99fd0.mp4?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini-Games</strong></h2>The mini-games are very varied so you'll never get bored. Racing, puzzle, reflex-based, platforming, vision sharpness, you name it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/69cabfc0b17ab165cf2ab4114252689d.poster.avif?t=1720787293\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/69cabfc0b17ab165cf2ab4114252689d.webm?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/69cabfc0b17ab165cf2ab4114252689d.mp4?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local/Online</strong></h2>You can play locally on the same computer with multiple controllers. Or if you and your friends are not able to gather in one place then you can still enjoy the game together online.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/ef69c65dff8de62e7e64807d0aa210e3.poster.avif?t=1720787293\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/ef69c65dff8de62e7e64807d0aa210e3.webm?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/ef69c65dff8de62e7e64807d0aa210e3.mp4?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Matchmaking</strong></h2>Play the game with people from all over the world with online matchmaking!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/e90e5c02acd7a5e68f9ba8b95329072d.poster.avif?t=1720787293\" width=760 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/e90e5c02acd7a5e68f9ba8b95329072d.webm?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/e90e5c02acd7a5e68f9ba8b95329072d.mp4?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skins Editor</strong></h2>You can customize your character to your liking with a huge array of cosmetics. All for free!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/240f64fb572cdbc04e2be231c5e99fd0.poster.avif?t=1720787293\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/240f64fb572cdbc04e2be231c5e99fd0.webm?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925400/extras/240f64fb572cdbc04e2be231c5e99fd0.mp4?t=1720787293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
